### 결제 요청
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456"
}

### 결제 콜백 (PG 시뮬레이터가 호출)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "20260317:TR:abc123",
  "orderId": "1",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": 20000,
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "reason": "정상 승인되었습니다."
}

### 결제 수동 복구 (관리자 — LDAP 인증 필요)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api-admin/v1/payments/1/recover
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin-ldap-token
